  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0020" flags="0x0">
    <title>Temp Ignition Retard multiplier by load</title>
    <description>CSV definition. File offset 0x7152; 8 columns x 1 rows.
8-point unsigned-byte curve. Code 0x248FA reads the curve using coordinate 0x8288. Axis data at 0x4B91, after the 3-byte descriptor. Axis input is calculated load F74D, NOT throttle/pedal position. Axis values are original internal units (raw), with factor 1 and offset 0. Multiplier = N*100/256 percent (128 = 50%, 255 = 99.609375%). Applied thermal correction = floor(thermal_lookup * multiplier_raw / 256), then 0.75 degrees per unit. One row with the 8 load points on X.
X: Load (internal); ROM $4B91; X
Y: -; no ROM axis in CSV; zero-based index labels</description>
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x0" mmedaddress="0x4b91" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedcolcount="8" mmedmajorstridebits="8" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>Load (internal) (raw)</units>
      <indexcount>8</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>2</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <embedinfo type="1" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
