  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0021" flags="0x0">
    <title>MAF sensor linearization (shared)</title>
    <description>CSV definition. File offset 0xD202; 512 columns x 1 rows.
Shared curve outside the switchable calibration banks: 512 unsigned 16-bit little-endian values, 1024 bytes. Indexed word reads at 0x82D6 and 0x8338. Flow display = (N - 2000)*0.1 kg/h; offset word 2000 is stored at 0xD200. ECU subtracts the offset after averaging and clamps negative results to zero. Negative displayed low-end values describe the curve before clamping, not negative measured airflow. Index 0..511; no unverified voltage conversion. Last value 10307 = 830.7 kg/h. Do not duplicate at +0x2C000.
