    <title>Temp Ignition Retard multiplier by load</title>
    <description>CSV definition. File offset 0x33152; 8 columns x 1 rows.
8-point unsigned-byte curve. Code 0x248FA reads the curve using coordinate 0x8288. Axis data at 0x30B91, after the 3-byte descriptor. Axis input is calculated load F74D, NOT throttle/pedal position. Axis values are original internal units (raw), with factor 1 and offset 0. Multiplier = N*100/256 percent (128 = 50%, 255 = 99.609375%). Applied thermal correction = floor(thermal_lookup * multiplier_raw / 256), then 0.75 degrees per unit. One row with the 8 load points on X.
